# Disjoint Tensor Borrows Demo
# Demonstrates borrowing non-overlapping slices of a tensor simultaneously
#
# AXYON allows multiple mutable borrows of the same tensor IF the
# borrowed slices are disjoint (non-overlapping ranges).

